WEBVTT

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.160
Soon after I entered the central park...

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.800
Yuya!

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.680
What happened there?

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.160
Why hasn't Yuya woken up for two days?

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.010
We couldn't find Sora either.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.260
Why?

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.710
Why did this happen?

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.580
If Yuya never wakes up again...

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.800
Don't worry.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:45.890
Yuya isn't that weak.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:52.800
For three years after his dad vanished, 
he's been hiding inside his shell.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.130
Just like how he woke up in his 
battle against Strong Ishijima,

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:02.480
he'll wake up again stronger than before.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.840
Oh no, my darling!

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:08.360
Don't leave Mieru behind and die!

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.820
Who is she?

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.160
Mieru Houchun!

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.780
Darling!

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:14.290
Outta the way!

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:20.540
I won't let you die!

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:23.930
Mieru is here to save you!

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:28.530
With my fortunetelling and magic, 
I'll bring my darling back to life!

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:32.530
But he isn't dead...

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:38.880
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:44.080
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:47.090
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.350
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:54.100
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.770
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:59.570
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:10.690
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:16.160
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:21.760
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:25.900
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:29.840
Repeating Up/Down

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:32.170
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:39.450
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:42.880
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:47.890
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:54.960
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:54.960 --> 00:03:05.470
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:08.180
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:10.880
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.670
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.420
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:25.980
Four Dimensions

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:29.860
A blue curtain on the south window.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.960
A pink or orange curtain on the west.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:35.040
I'll place a power stone 
on my darling's pillow

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.860
to ward off evil spirits 
and raise his health.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:42.060
Hmm, aquamarine or tourmaline will be best.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.380
Hey!

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:53.810
What are you doing?

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:56.400
That's what I should be saying!

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:00.550
If my darling wears these 
pajamas, he'll never heal!

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:03.160
Grey absorbs luck.

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:07.030
If you don't want my darling to get 
weaker, change his clothes immediately!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.230
The color should be green and white!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.720
Green?

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:12.730
And white?

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:18.900
Green has a detoxifying 
effect, and white purifies.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:24.230
This is for my darling!  Stop 
doing nothing and hurry up!

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.360
How did you know that Yuya was asleep?

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:35.520
Was it your fortunetelling?

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.190
I want to say yes,

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:44.580
but actually, I overheard your schoolkids 
anxiously talking at the tournament arena.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.960
So I ditched everything and came here.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.800
I'm glad that I came.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:54.680
Because he's been badly mistreated.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.730
Wait, you said you ditched everything?

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.800
Did you abandon your match?

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.680
In the Maiami Championship?

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.280
Of course!

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:08.420
Mieru's darling is more 
important than dueling!

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:13.760
That's wrong!

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:17.630
Yuya is a duelist!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:23.470
As a fellow duelist, Yuya would 
want Mieru to win the tournament!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.470
Victory is the best medicine!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.680
To bring more luck, what's more effective 
than curtains, stones or pajamas is...

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:33.700
Victory!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.060
If Mieru wins...

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.650
Yuya will wake up!

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:41.890
Maybe you're right...

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:43.100
Exactly!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.320
Hurry back to the arena!

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:54.960
Understood!  Mieru will do 
her best for her darling!

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:05.600
Today's first match in the Maiami 
Championship's Junior Youth division!

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:08.040
It's supposed to be between

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:12.040
Fuma Duel School's Tsukikage and Unno 
Fortunetelling School's Mieru Houchun.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:15.920
However, Houchun hasn't shown up yet!

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:19.900
If she doesn't show up, 
Tsukikage wins by forfeit!

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:25.260
You won't win by forfeit!

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:28.970
Where's that from?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:34.430
Whoa!  Houchun has finally arrived!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:36.910
What's this?

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:41.860
Two minutes.  That's how long it'll 
take until you grovel before Mieru.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.700
Actually, you won't just grovel.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.390
I'll put you into a deep sleep for eternity!

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:51.890
Houchun declares that she'll win!

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:55.060
And my darling will...

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.380
Thank you, Mieru.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:08.280
Yuya.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:10.410
Yuzu...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.480
Mom...

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:16.010
Two days?

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.500
Yes.  You were in a deep sleep.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.420
You were very tired.

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:24.020
It's only natural because 
you kept dueling nonstop

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:28.400
after you already battled four times 
to enter the Junior Youth Championship.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:32.000
Oh!  What's happening in the tournament?

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.430
For Junior Youth, the first round ends today.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:39.240
Fortunetelling School's Mieru 
Houchun is dueling right now.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:42.680
Huh?

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:45.660
Where's Mieru's match?

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:48.500
It's already over?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:55.620
Fuma Duel School's Tsukikage 
won with a one turn kill!

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.530
Mieru lost?

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:09.230
The Maiami Championship is high level.

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:12.680
There are many skilled competitors 
that we know nothing about.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:20.480
Junior Class is in the second round, and 
Futoshi dueled LDS's Layra yesterday.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.450
Isn't Layra the one who defeated Ayu?

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:29.150
Yes.  He used Fusion Summon 
last time, but this time...

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.320
Synchro Summon!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:39.200
That gives me shivers!

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:47.620
Synchro?

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:52.480
Yeah.  Even though he's Junior 
Class, he does attend LDS.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:59.340
Maybe he's like Reiji Akaba and 
can use Fusion, Synchro and Xyz.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.640
Fusion...  Synchro...  Xyz...

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:06.900
What's wrong?

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.620
I met Ute that night.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:15.770
He said that this world has been 
separated into four dimensions.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:17.750
Four dimensions?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:22.400
Fusion, Synchro, Xyz.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.830
And we live in Standard.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:31.220
Sora came from Fusion, and Ute 
and Kurosaki came from Xyz.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:36.690
Their two dimensions are fighting, and 
Sora battled Ute in front of my eyes.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.700
And vanished.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.360
Vanished?

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:45.100
Ute said that he was forced 
to return to Fusion Dimension.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.760
Ute said that?

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.400
Yeah.  And then Hugo appeared.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:53.540
Who's Hugo?

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:57.420
Hugo is another guy who looks like me.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:00.380
He arrived on a motorcycle.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:01.680
Duel!

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:08.620
Hugo is a duelist from Synchro Dimension.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.380
Synchro?

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:16.400
But Ute was battling against 
Fusion to rescue Ruri.

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.860
Hugo may have taken her.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:25.180
Ute said that Fusion has a minion in Synchro.

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:30.740
I think the two battled 
before, so back then...

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:32.940
You're the one who stole from me!

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:36.010
Be quiet!  We'll talk after I defeat you!

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.500
Synchro Summon!

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:43.820
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.090
Xyz Summon!

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:52.120
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.100
That's...

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.220
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:19.260
Why do you have Ute's card?

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:24.280
He saved me.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:28.730
Whirlwind Hell Dive Slasher!

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.070
Yuya!

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:40.280
Ute, hang in there!  Are you okay?

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.480
Make people smile by dueling.

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:56.140
Use your power to bring smiles 
to the world and the future.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:00.930
My power?

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:12.510
I don't know what happened afterwards, 
nor what happened to Ute.

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:25.080
Why did he give me this card?

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.880
Ute said to make people smile by dueling.

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:31.400
And then he gave me this card.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:33.600
Why did he do that?

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:35.800
Yuya...

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:39.900
I don't understand, and I'm 
not just talking about Ute.

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:42.310
Who is Hugo?

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:46.410
Why do they look like me?

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:50.750
I don't know what's going on!

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.820
Why do Ute and Hugo look like me?

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:56.820
You're not the only one.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.760
There's also someone who looks like me.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:13.820
Please send me back to Standard again!

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:17.680
There are refugees who escaped from Xyz!

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:21.260
Please give me another chance!

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:25.820
I'll defeat those Xyz this time 
until there are none left!

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:28.550
Looks just like Yuzu?

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:32.520
Ute said that Ruri looks just like you?

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:36.420
Yes.  He said that he was surprised at first.

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:39.730
That's why he called me Ruri.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:41.850
What's going on?

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:46.860
Ute and Hugo look like me, 
and Ruri looks like Yuzu.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.120
Why?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.660
Kurosaki might know why.

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:59.980
He's Ute's friend.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.520
Since Ute and Sora are gone,

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:08.100
Kurosaki is the only one we can ask about 
dimensions and the people who look like me.

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.770
And about Ruri.

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:13.770
He's Ruri's brother, right?

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:21.180
I'm heading out for a bit!

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:23.050
Are you okay?

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:25.050
Yeah!  I'm leaving!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:27.540
Wait!  Where are you going?

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:28.880
Center court!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:34.510
Sheesh.  To think he was asleep for two days.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:38.910
But once he makes up his mind, 
he has to act immediately.

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:42.710
He's becoming more and more like you.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:58.560
I overlay Level 5 Algiedi and Kaus!

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:04.150
Light of the stars, shake 
the earth and descend!

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.620
Xyz Summon!

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:08.350
Constellar Pleiades!

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:15.360
Then I overlay Level 6 Pollux and Siat!

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:17.640
Xyz Summon!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:23.140
Appear, Rank 6 Constellar Ptolemy M7!

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.460
All right!  Hokuto did it!

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.610
This is LDS's skill!

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:42.050
Let's hurry!

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.260
Huh?

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.200
Ayu!  What are you doing?

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.080
Hurry up!

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:56.970
Yuzu was just there.

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:00.740
Huh?

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.650
She wouldn't be there!

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:05.370
Everyone is at center court!

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:07.620
Hurry up or we'll leave you behind!

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:09.540
Wait up!

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.950
Yuya!

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:19.660
Nothing else makes the 
man Gongenzaka happier!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.140
I was so worried these past two days!

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:25.320
You're exaggerating.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:28.900
No, everyone was truly worried.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:32.080
What would we do if you didn't wake up?

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.940
Yuya!

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:40.380
Thank goodness!

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:42.750
I'm so happy that it gives me shivers!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.440
Now if Sora returns...

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:48.020
You Show School will be back to normal.

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:51.690
You're right.  We can't celebrate yet.

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:53.440
I'm sorry, Yuya.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:57.980
We've kept searching for him, but 
we still don't know where Sora went.

00:16:58.290 --> 00:16:59.300
Umm...

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:00.170
I'm sorry!

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:05.200
I shouldn't be celebrating either.

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:08.370
I lost yesterday.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:09.940
I heard.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:15.410
Layra defeated you by 
Synchro Summoning, right?

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:19.600
Yeah.  I can't believe he can also Synchro.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.940
I was so surprised that I got shivers.

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:25.990
Then you make him shiver next time, Futoshi!

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.710
The next tournament is a year away.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.510
Improve your entertainment 
dueling at You Show School and-

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.880
There is no next!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:37.870
There is no "next" in a real battle!

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:40.220
Yuya?

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:41.940
What's wrong, Yuya?

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:43.220
It's nothing.

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:44.940
Darling!

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:48.050
You woke up, darling!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:49.080
Mieru!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:54.990
Mieru prayed with all 
her life, and it worked!

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:58.180
Huh?

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:09.080
Yuya Sakaki, you came to watch me duel?

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:13.450
So what's your impression after 
witnessing my true power?

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.310
In our duel at You Show School, it was luck-

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.400
I want to meet Kurosaki.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.640
I need to talk to him.

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:20.100
Talk about what?

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.570
We'll tell him directly.

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:24.770
Yuzu.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.770
Let me meet Kurosaki.

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:28.820
I have to ask him some things.

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:29.940
That's not possible.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:34.000
Kurosaki won't meet you.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.600
Even we're barely allowed to talk with him.

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:39.400
Where's Reiji Akaba?

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:41.970
Let me meet him immediately!

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.900
The President is busy.  It's not possible.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.820
Since that night, I can't 
get in contact with Ute.

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:50.110
Maybe you know something.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:52.960
Me?  I don't know anything.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:04.290
Since you came here, watch the next match.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:07.260
It's between me and Isao Kachidoki.

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:09.120
It'll be worth it!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:17.770
Everyone, it's the final match in the first 
round of the Junior Youth Championship!

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:23.540
The winner will be the 32nd hero 
that moves on to the second round!

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:29.310
Will it be Leo Duel School's Yaiba Toudou?

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:36.660
Or will it be last year's runner-up 
Isao Kachidoki of Ryozanpaku School?

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:39.120
Their skills are verified!

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:43.230
It will be a fiery battle that 
will make our palms sweat!

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:44.600
Duel!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.720
What's this?

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.550
Yaiba!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:32.080
This is how Ryozanpaku School duels.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:35.710
This isn't a duel!  I won't accept it!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.600
Bring smiles to the future.

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.170
Yuya?

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:55.770
The first round of the Junior Youth 
Championship is now complete.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:59.840
Let's announce the matchups 
for the second round.

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:06.400
Winners, please insert your registration 
cards into your Duel Disks.

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:14.650
I'm in tomorrow's first match.

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:17.710
My opponent is Surprise 
School's Yuzo Tanegashima.

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:22.600
I'm in the second day's second match 
against Duelie Club's Mikiyo Naname.

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.650
What about you, Yuya?

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.040
Isao Kachidoki?

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.120
No way!

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:33.880
Yuya...

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.600
Ute said to make people smile by dueling.

00:21:39.320 --> 00:21:45.740
I don't know what he really wanted to tell 
me, but I'll duel the way I believe in!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:49.620
That's the best way to 
respond to Ute's wishes!

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:02.970
Isao Kachidoki, I don't accept 
your method of dueling.

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:05.500
Duels are to make people smile.

00:22:06.780 --> 00:22:10.980
My dueling will bring a 
smile back to your heart!

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:35.110
As long as there's a smile

00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:41.890
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:47.190
I always believe

00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:50.710
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.060 --> 00:22:56.340
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:22:59.610 --> 00:23:04.980
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:11.850
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:18.520
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:22.590
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:48.620 --> 00:23:51.280
Ryozanpaku School's Isao Kachidoki

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:54.880
was the runner-up in last year's 
Junior Youth Championship.

00:23:55.080 --> 00:23:59.540
He's the #1 favorite to win 
this year's tournament.

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:03.600
But how can someone so 
skilled duel so violently?

00:24:03.600 --> 00:24:06.170
He's so intense that it gives me shivers.

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.770
Will Yuya be okay?

00:24:09.680 --> 00:24:13.600
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Awaken to Wrath

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.940
The fun is only getting started!
